<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Alade Israel Anuoluwapo - Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --accent: #38bdf8;
            --accent-hover: #0284c7;
            --border: #334155;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .bio {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            background-color: var(--accent);
            color: #0f172a;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: background 0.2s ease;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-hover);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: var(--text-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background-color: var(--border);
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        section {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        @media(min-width: 600px) {
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <header>
        <h1>Alade Israel Anuoluwapo</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">Food Scientist | Personal Brand Storyteller | Data Specialist</div>
        <p class="bio">
            Observant, creative, and analytical Food Scientist specializing in narrative structuring, founder brand storytelling, product quality research, data annotation, and executive communications.
        </p>
        <div class="links">
            <a href="mailto:contact@aladeisrael.com" class="btn">Email Me</a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Download CV</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>Core Focus</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Food Science & Quality Assurance</h3>
                <p>Expertise in food technology research, quality control protocols, product development, and processing standards.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Founder Storytelling</h3>
                <p>Extracting hidden narratives, building founder story banks, and turning workplace moments into high-impact content.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Data & Linguistic Analysis</h3>
                <p>Annotating datasets, refining Yoruba NLP models, and ensuring precision across natural language tasks.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Executive Communications</h3>
                <p>Speechwriting, editorial calendar direction, and multi-channel content strategy for executive leadership.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 Alade Israel Anuoluwapo. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</div>

</body>
</html>
